==English==

===Etymology===

The term is sometimes used as a sub category of '[[childlover]]'. [[Pedophiles]], [[Ephebophiles]] and 'Pedophile' / 'Youth liberation' advocates created this set of definitions, as 'Pedophile' has become a false [[synonym]] for an often [[sadistic]] child abuser.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
#A male-oriented non-[[sadistic]] [[pedophile]] or [[ephebophile]].

